EXPRESS
npm install express

Web server framework


PASSPORT
npm install passport
TYPESCRIPT: npm install -D @types/passport

Authentication framework


GOOGLE OAUTH
npm install passport-google-oauth20
TYPESCRIPT: npm install -D @types/passport-google-oauth20

Google OAuth strategy for Passport


DOTENV
npm install dotenv

Loads secrets from .env file


MONGOOSE
npm install mongoose

Connects Node.js to MongoDB
Provides schemas and models


EXPRESS-SESSION
npm install express-session
W TYPESCRIPT: npm install -D @types/express-session

Stores login sessions
Keeps users logged in

NODEMON
npm install -g nodemon
OR: npm install -D nodemon
nodemon SCRIPT.js

auto updates server script

NODEMON W Typescript
npm install -D ts-node

BYCRYPT
npm install bcrypt
TYPESCRIPT: npm install -D @types/bcrypt

for encrypting passwords.

NODEMAILER
npm install nodemailer

for sending emails

RESEND
npm install resend

for sending emails

EXPRESS W TYPESCRIPT
npm install -D @types/express

for running server code with typescript

CORS
npm install cors
npm install -D @types/cors

to prevent error due to backend and frontend being on different ports.

ROUTES
npm install react-router-dom

CHESSBOARD
npm install react-chessboard chess.js

STRIPE
npm install stripe
npm install -g @stripe/cli
stripe listen --forward-to localhost:3000/api/stripe/webhook